      "id": 98363,
      "is_admin": true,
      "is_moderator": true,
      "is_staff": true,
      "last_edit_date": 0,
      "message_parsed": "<blockquote class=\"xfBb-quote\" data-name=\"haribo\">Deprecation Notice: Constant E_STRICT is deprecated in /usr/share/php/Composer/Util/Silencer.php:36<br />\n ubuntu 24 lts server php8.4 (torrentpier-master)</blockquote>Hi! Thanks for reporting this issue.<br />\n<br />\nThis deprecation notice occurs because PHP 8.4 has deprecated the E_STRICT constant. The constant E_STRICT was used in older PHP versions to report coding standards warnings, but it became redundant after PHP 5.4 when those checks were merged into other error levels. PHP 8.4 has now officially deprecated it.<br />\n<br />\nThe warning is coming from Composer&#039;s Silencer.php file, which still references this deprecated constant in older versions.<br />\n<br />\nPlease update Composer to the latest version:<br />\n<pre class=\"xfBb-code\" data-lang=\"bash\">composer self-update</pre>",
